<newsitem itemid="676904" id="root" date="1997-06-20" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Morgan Stanley sets warrants on UK share basket.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets warrants on UK share basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley (Jersey) Ltd has issued 500,000 American-style call warrants on a basket of UK stores shares, lead manager Morgan Stanley &amp; Co International Ltd.</p>
<p>The basket consists of shares of Burton Group Plc, Dixons Group Plc, Great Universal Stores Plc, Kingfisher Plc and Next Plc. One basket is controlled by 10 shares.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,250 STG</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     9.85 STG</p>
<p> GEARING	   10.74 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   18.JUN.99</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   18.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    1,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1,058 STG</p>
<p>NOTES:</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
